## Contact-form email settings — server-side only (never exposed to the browser).
## Do NOT prefix these with VITE_, or Vite will bundle them into the client JS.
##
## 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on your Google account (required for App Passwords):
##    https://myaccount.google.com/security
## 2. Create an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
##    (choose "Mail" as the app — Google gives you a 16-character password)
## 3. Copy this file to .env for local `vercel dev` testing, and add the same
##    two variables in your Vercel project's Settings → Environment Variables.
GMAIL_USER=youraddress@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
